      "characterImg": "character_13.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_04.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Go on. I'm fine, I got this.",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:m3k7p1w5",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_04.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Scarlett? You changed with him? Divorced and already chasing a new guy? So cheap.",
      "characterName": "Chloe",
      "characterImg": "character_02.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_04.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "You’re the mistress who stole your sister’s husband—who do you think you are to judge me?",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:m3k7p1w5",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_04.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Shut up! Chloe’s a billionaire heiress—she got Harrington to invest in my company. You’re just a poor, dumped woman.",
      "characterName": "Blake",
      "characterImg": "character_07.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_04.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "I do belong here. I helped build this company—I can come anytime I want.",
      "characterName": "Scarlett",
      "characterImg": "result:m3k7p1w5",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_04.webp",
      "characterPos": 0
    },
    {
      "dialogue": "Ha! Delusional! Apologize to Chloe now and get out!",
      "characterName": "Blake",
      "characterImg": "character_01.webp",
      "backgroundImg": "bg_04.webp",
      "characterPos": 2
